# Story Planning

## Goal
Plan the stories (剧情段) of the chapter from its plan.

## Requirements
- 1-3 stories per chapter.
- Story titles must be concise and evocative.
- Story descriptions must be 1-2 sentences covering what happens.
- Story word counts must sum to the chapter's expected word count.
- Output JSON with a `stories` array. Each story has `title`, `description`, and `expected_word_count`.

